      "id": 21,
      "options": {
        "content": "### How to read this dashboard\n\n**Codex request** means a model turn Coditor observed through Envoy Responses traffic, not every ChatGPT backend call.\n\n**Requested model** comes from the Responses request body. **Served model** comes from response headers or the Responses payload.\n\n**Cached input %** uses Responses usage fields. Cached input is a subset of input, not extra input.\n\n**Context fill** uses Codex input tokens divided by the configured or inferred context window.\n\n**Failed or incomplete responses** come from terminal Responses stream status events observed by Envoy.\n\n**Diagnostic causes** are limited to Envoy-derived Codex status, model mismatch, token/accounting, and context signals.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0",
      "title": "Terminology Guide",
      "description": "Short definitions for the dashboard's main terms and KPIs.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 40
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 70
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * sum(coditor_tokens_total{provider=\"codex_responses\",kind=\"cached_input\"}) / clamp_min(sum(coditor_tokens_total{provider=\"codex_responses\",kind=\"input\"}), 1)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Codex cached input % since start",
      "description": "Share of Codex input tokens that came from provider cache reuse. Higher is usually better.",
      "type": "stat"
    },
